dust-adapter

Adapter application sources were extracted from the wbr_control working tree,
with source hashes recorded in docs/migration_sources.json. Existing SPDX and
copyright notices are retained. Repository-owned sources use Apache-2.0 unless
a file states otherwise.

Zephyr, HPM support/SDK, CherryUSB, SEGGER and FatFs are external dependencies
with their respective licences. They are not relicensed by this repository.

The EtherCAT Slave Stack Code (SSC 5.13) in external/ssc is a separately
licensed Beckhoff dependency, included for the HPM5E3Y application following
the repository maintainer's confirmation of chip-vendor authorization.
Original licence notices are retained in every source file. The root Apache-2.0
licence does not apply to external/ssc. Refer to the licence linked in its README.
